<h3><u>Dard-e-jigar</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Dard-e-jigar</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</font></p><font size=""4"">
<ol><li>Teri Qabr-e-Peh Amman(s.a.) Dard-e-Jigar Sunaaon<br>
Yeh Khoon Bhara Kurta Kaisay Tujhay Dikhaaon</li><p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p><li>Amman(s.a.) Yeh Aik Kurta Samaan Mein Bacha Hai</li><p>Amman(s.a.) Meray Akhi Ka Kurta Lahoo Bhara Hai</p><p>Marqad Mein Is Ko Rakh Lo Soghaat-e-Shaam Samjho</p><p>Tum Is Ko Piyar Karlo Aankhon Say Mein Lagaaon </p><p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p><li>Amman(s.a.) Libaas-e-Kohna Manga Tha Jab Akhi Nay</li><p>Amman(s.a.) Mujhay Tha Maara Us Waqt Zindagi Nay</p><p>Mein To Samajh Gai Thi Marnay Chala Hai Bhai(a.s.)</p><p>Woh Dastaan Sunakar Mein Khud Hi Mar Na Jaaon</p><p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p><li>Amman(s.a.) Tera Gulshan Karbobala Mein Ujrha</li><p>Amman(s.a.) Tera Kunba Seh Roz Raha Piyasa</p><p>Khaimay Jalay Hain Amman(s.a.) Looti Gaein Ridaen</p><p>Main(s.a.) Dastaan Safar Ki Kia Kia Tujhay Bataon</p><p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p><li>Amman(s.a.) Meri Rida Ka Zamin Jo Eik Jari Tha</li><p>Amman(s.a.) Woh Mera Bhaiyya(a.s.) Jo Aks-e-Haidery(a.s.) Tha</p><p>Baazoo Qalam Tha Usk Ka Ghum Ko Bhi Ghum Tha Us Ka</p><p>Us Khoon Bharay Alam Ko Palkon Peh Mein Uthaon</p><p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p><li>Amman(s.a.) Woh Shaam Walay Nana(s.a.w.w.) Kay Ummati Woh</li><p>Amman(s.a.) Qasam Khuda Ki Thay Is Qadar Shaqi Woh</p><p>Bachchon Peh Zulm Kar Kay Khushian Mana Rahay Thay</p><p>Rahon Mein Marnay Walay Bachchay Kahan Say Laaon</p><p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p><li>Amman(s.a.) Tumhari Beti(s.a.) Woh Kaam Kar Kay Aai</li><p>Amman(s.a.) Wahan Bhi Mein Nay Farsh-e-Aza Bichaai</p><p>Kehtay Hain Jis Ko Zindaan Us Ki Zamin Thi Hairaan</p><p>Khud Keh Keh Raha Tha Zindan Farsh-e-Aza Bichaaon</p><p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p><li>Amman(s.a.) Ridaen Sar Say Cheni Gaein Hamari</li><p>Amman(s.a.) Safar Ki Khatir Be Parda Thi Amari</p><p>Pathar Baras Rahay Thay Sar Say Lahoo Tha Jari</p><p>Haal-e-Safar Sunakar Ab Kia Tumhein Rulaaon</p><p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p><li>Amman(s.a.) Mein Shaam Jakar Zinda Rahi Hoon Kaisay</li><p>Amman(s.a.) Safar Ki Sakhti Zahir Hai Bazoon Say</p><p>Bazoo Peh Jo Nishan Hain Soghat Hain Safar Ki</p><p>Chehray Ki Gard Apnay Kis Tarha Say Chupaaon</p><p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p><li>Amman(s.a.) Main Thak Gai Hoon Seenay Say Ab Lagaalo</li></ol>

<p>Amman(s.a.) Mujhay Khudara Pehloo Mein Tum Sulaalo</p>
<p>Tukhrhay Jigar Hai Mera Kaisa Safar Hai Mera</p>
<p>Tum Hi Bataao Amman(s.a.) Kab Tak Main Chalti Jaaon</p>
<p>(Amman Mein Aai Hoon Amman Mein Aai Hoon) x2</p></font></p>
